    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wacu kumae ni ng’atu ma juwiro pare, ni Kuro, m’amaku cinge ma yor acwic, kara anyon thek i wang’e, man abigonyo pier ju m’ubimo: kara ayab dhugola i wang’e, e jubiciko dhugang’ ungo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abicidho i weng’i, man abipoto ka ma tek; abituro dhugola mi mola nziki nziki, man abithumo utwindi mi nyunyu pu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man abimio iri piny m’akana mi mudho, ku lonyo m’aponda mi ka ma kende, kara ing’ei nia en e an, Yehova, m’alwong’i ku nyingi, cil Mungu mir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni kum Yakobo ma jatic para, man Israel m’afoyo, alwong’i ku nyingi: acaku nyingi mi pak, kadok fodi ing’eya ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An a Yehova, man ng’atu moko mange mbe; Mungu moko mbe m’umeda. Abitwio pieri, kadok fodi ing’eya ngo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara ging’ei ugambre i wokceng’, man ugambre yo reto, nia ng’atu moko mbe m’umeda: an a Yehova, man ng’atu moko mange mbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atimo der, man acwio mudho; atimo kwiocwiny, man aketho lem ma rac; an a Yehova, m’utimo gin maeni ceke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
