          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.29.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 29:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 9:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Can wi ng’atu m’upiemo piem ku Jacwicne mire! dekle i kind dekle m’i ng’om mire! Ulobo biwacu ni ng’atu m’ung’ine kumae, Itimo ang’o? kadi tic peri kumae, Cinge mbe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Can wi ng’atu m’uwacu ni wego kumae, Inyolo ang’o? kadi ni dhaku kumae, le peri en e ang’o?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova, Ng’atu Maleng’ mir Israel, man Jacwicne wacu kumae: Penja pi gin ma bibino; pi wota, man pi tic m’i cinga, wung’ol ira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atimo ng’om, man acwio dhanu i wie: an, en e cinga, m’uluko polo; man ang’olo lembe ni udul migi ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ating’e malu i bedopwe, man abitiro yo pare ceke: ebigomo adhura para, man ebigonyo ju ma judakugi para, pi wel piny kadi sukulia de ngo, Yehova mir udul uwacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wacu kumae, Tic mi muli mi Misiri, man kuloka mir Ethiopia, ku dhanu mi Seba, dhanu ma boco, gibikadhu i beng’i, e gibibedo peri: gibilubo ng’ei; gibibino atwia ku nyoro; man gibipodho piny i beng’i, gibikwayu kwac i beng’i, gibiwacu kumae, Andha Mungu ni kudi; man ng’atu moko mbe, Mungu moko mbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andha in i Mungu m’ipondo giri, E Mungu mir Israel ma Jalar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lewic bimakugi, eyo, cwinygi bing’abre, kagi ceke; gibimondo i lewic karacelo ma gi jutim mungu m’araga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Israel biboth ni kum Yehova ku both mi nja: lewic bimakuwu ngo kadi cwinywu de bing’abre ngo mi nja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Yehova m’ucwio polo, Mungu m’ung’ino ng’om m’utime de, m’uketho ecungo m’ucwie de ni uvuru ngo, m’ung’ine kara jubed i ie, uwacu kumae: An a Yehova; man ng’atu mange mbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayero mung’ mung’ ungo, i ka mi ng’om mi mudho; awacu ngo kumae ni kodhi Yakobo, Wuyenya mananu: an, Yehova, ayero bedopwe, ayero gin m’atira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wucokru giwu man wubin; wucor ceng’ni karacelo, wun ma wuboth i kind thek: ng’eyong’ec migi mbe gi ju ma giyeyo yen mir ayi gin m’acwia migi m’ang’ika, ma girwo de ni mungu ma copo bodho ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuyer, man wuwodhe woko; eyo, wek gipor lembe karacelo: ng’a m’unyutho maeni ugambre i nindo ma coni? ng’a m’uyero maeni ugambre coni? an ungo, Yehova? man Mungu mange mbe m’umeda, Mungu ma pwe man Jalar; ng’atu moko mbe m’umeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunen bang’a, man wubothi, wu tung’ ng’om ceke; kum an a Mungu, man ng’atu mange mbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 14:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.2.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Flp 2:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwongra kuda gira, lembe ai kud i dhoga i bedopwe, man ebidwogo ngo, nia cong ceke kubang’e kubang’e birum ira, leb ceke kubang’e kubang’e bikwong’o kwong’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
